@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8005

### API information
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Ask the RAG tutor a question
POST {{baseUrl}}/rag/ask
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the divergence theorem?"
}

### Ingest the configured Vector Calculus PDF
POST {{baseUrl}}/rag/ingest
Accept: application/json
